/**
 * Comprehensive, runnable X API v2 Java SDK Cookbook covering every major developer use-case and
 * all 24 API endpoint groups.
 *
 * <p>Run standalone against the built-in local X API simulator (or against the live X API when
 * {@code X_BEARER_TOKEN} / OAuth credentials are set):
